error[elab/struct-field-name-mismatch]: expected field 'COUNT', but found 'VALUE'
  ┌─ elab/struct-field-name.watsup:3:12
  │
1 │ syntax record = { COUNT nat }
  │                   ----- expected field declared here
2 │ dec $f : record
  │          ------ return value of function '$f' expects 'record'
3 │ def $f = { VALUE 1 }
  │            ^^^^^ unexpected field
  │
  = Struct fields must appear in declaration order.

